      "content": "thanks for the insight. but some people in legal are worried that prioritizing specific outcomes this way could actually be considered discriminatory against other groups. if we're basically engineering specific results, doesn't that just create its own set of fairness issues? how would you respond to the argument that equality of opportunity is the only legally and ethically defensible path?",
